- The kernel module in driver/ is under the GNU General Public License,
  version 2 only (GPL-2.0), as a Linux kernel module. The text is in LICENSE
  at the top of this repo.
- driver/ruxnpvg_proto.h and uapi/pvg_drm.h, the device's numbers and the
  interface programs include, are under the MIT licence below, so that a
  program or a user-mode driver of any licence can include them. So are
  package/build-mesa.sh, package/vm-mesa.sh and package/drirc/10-pvg.conf.
- Everything else in package/ is under GPL-2.0-or-later, as the rest of this
  repo is. The files there with no SPDX line (package control files, unit
  files, settings) are too.

